@title Inspector on the contactor at 1920x1080: no trip curve, breaking capacity or let-through rows
@area Schematic
@sizes 1920x1080
click_text "Open example"
wait 30
click 585 312
wait 40
shot contactor-inspector
expect_not "Trip curve"
expect_not "Breaking capacity"
expect "Rated current"
expect_not "Relay setting"
